package/wpewebkit: bump to version 2.52.6

Buildroot master (as of 2026-11) still has 2.50.5. 2.52 is the last WPE WebKit series with the ARMv7
JavaScript JIT (2.54 switched it off; main deleted it). Applied to the Buildroot checkout by
tools/patch-buildroot.sh (webOS browser).

Also drops Buildroot's 0001-CMake-4.4 WebKit patch: the fix is upstream in 2.52 and the patch no longer applies.

---
diff --git a/package/wpewebkit/0001-CMake-4.4-WPE-_WEBKIT_TARGET_LINK_FRAMEWORK-reports-.patch b/package/wpewebkit/0001-CMake-4.4-WPE-_WEBKIT_TARGET_LINK_FRAMEWORK-reports-.patch
